      "paragraph_idx": 84,
      "snippet": "The AI Diffusion IFR would divide the world into three tiers, relegating most countries to \u201cTier 2\u201d status. The AI Diffusion IFR would confer special benefits on select \u201cUniversal Verified End Users\u201d, or UVEU, and lesser benefits on \u201cNational Verified End Users\u201d, or NVEU. The AI Diffusion IFR would have numerous effects that may negatively impact our long-term financial results and competitive position, including but not limited to the following.",
